parisc: make radeon work on HP C8000 (combined)

All five patches of parisc-radeon-v2 squashed into one diff.
Base: b88c841d11641923fa3a4da011d7202cd89df68a (v7.3-rc6-390-gb88c841d1164)
Apply from the top of the kernel tree:  patch -p1 < parisc-c8000-radeon-combined.patch

  03e77d62245b parisc/sba_iommu: reserve and release every word of a multi-word IOVA range
  d0fc5eb769a8 drm/radeon: flush the ring through its vmap alias before committing
  064b72853c3d parisc/sba_iommu: clear ROPE_CONFIG bit 2 on ropes carrying an AGP bridge
  53f2538f12e2 parisc/sba_iommu: enable AGP support when parisc-agp is a module
  b8c29d19cddf parisc/sba_iommu: pad DMA mappings behind a Quicksilver AGP bridge

